[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Fedora Glass
GenericName=Theme Customizer
GenericName[de]=Design-Anpassung
GenericName[es]=Personalizador de temas
GenericName[fr]=Personnalisation du thème
GenericName[it]=Personalizzazione del tema
GenericName[pt_BR]=Personalizador de tema
Comment=A glass look for GNOME and your apps, from clear to frosted
Comment[de]=Ein Glas-Look für GNOME und Ihre Apps, von klar bis milchig
Comment[es]=Un aspecto de cristal para GNOME y tus aplicaciones, de transparente a esmerilado
Comment[fr]=Un style verre pour GNOME et vos applications, du transparent au dépoli
Comment[it]=Un aspetto in vetro per GNOME e le tue app, da trasparente a satinato
Comment[pt_BR]=Um visual de vidro para o GNOME e seus aplicativos, do transparente ao fosco
Exec=python3 -m fedoraglass gui
Icon=io.github.djshiye.LiquidGlass
Terminal=false
Categories=GNOME;GTK;Settings;DesktopSettings;
Keywords=theme;glass;blur;transparency;appearance;frosted;liquid;fedora;
Keywords[de]=Design;Thema;Glas;Unschärfe;Transparenz;Aussehen;milchig;
Keywords[es]=tema;cristal;desenfoque;transparencia;apariencia;esmerilado;
